<title>USA: Jefferies offers $100 mln 7.5 pct notes.</title>
<headline>Jefferies offers $100 mln 7.5 pct notes.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferies Group Inc said Tuesday it has offered $100 million of senior notes due 2007.</p>
<p>The company said the offering was priced at 99.72 percent for a yield-to-maturity rate of 7.5 pct with cash interest payable semi-annually.</p>
<p>The note will enable the investment banking company to increase its underwriting capabilities, it said.</p>
</text>
